what was asked) and the small feed icon/dialog with an editor that takes
over the right-hand panel whenever rules are ticked. It lists every feed
with its URL (so feeds with the same title can be told apart) and an
on / off / mixed state for the selection, with "Use all" / "Use none",
a sticky "Save feeds for N rules" bar, and Delete / Clear selection.

